                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Pretty much all the defaults from RPG maker, that I've seen in other RPGM games, were left in, from the sound effects to the character and enemy sprites to the tiles used in the academy, dungeons, final castle and other outdoor areas. The only thing is, once or twice it's not immediately clear how to proceed. In once case you need to push up against the top and jump off the cliff...Another time while jumping up cliffs my character got stuck so I had to restart the game. Also, developer seems to have same weird fixation on diapers, btw (item names).\n\nThe story is subpar and really, nothing special about it. Super easy until the very last boss, which was a crazy difficulty spike. Maybe I was under levelled, but barely beat it on my 3rd try, thing is, there is no way to go back out and grind, no enemies in the final area (even in the prison), for whatever reason. In all, retries of the last boss were probably about 1/3rd total play time. So game is also poorly balanced and overall, just not worth it.\n\nTook me 2 hours 30 minutes to beat.",
